# oracle: dump vtk legacy file (.vtk) with id type vx vy vz fx fy fz on a 4x4x4 fcc lj crystal (256 atoms), every 10 to step 20
# oracle-files: dump0.vtk dump10.vtk dump20.vtk dump0_boundingBox.vtk dump10_boundingBox.vtk dump20_boundingBox.vtk
# oracle-compare: filerel=1e-7
# Measured with native LAMMPS: max relative error 0 on values above 1e-6 in all six files (atoms at steps 0, 10, 20 and the bounding boxes); the largest absolute difference is 3.9e-15 on forces that are zero at step 0. Native build: /home/roy/.local/bin/lmp (b332f28). Engine time about 0.5 s warm (2.4 s for the first case of a process).
units           lj
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
velocity        all create 1.44 87287 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix             1 all nve
dump            d all vtk 10 dump*.vtk id type vx vy vz fx fy fz
thermo_style    custom step pe
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             20
